@voice larsen-hamid
// The Commons writer, draft 1 (non-story crew). Infirmary aide, day.
tpl: chatty
talk: Talks a lot, all of it in earnest. Shares health facts nobody asked for, kindly and at length. Has a plan for everything, especially the boat. Learning the guitar, badly, with Tamsin, and is honest that it isn't going well. Has started going to bed on time and is a bit smug about it.
cares: the boat he's saving for on the Ostrander colonies | getting the guitar right | everyone drinking enough water | the infirmary running smoothly
jokes: the boat has a name already, and the name changes every week | he and Tamsin practise guitar together, which makes it worse
hi: Hello hello | Ah, there you are | Hi there
bye: Drink some water! | Take care of yourself | Off you go, then
yes: Absolutely | Course I will | Yes, good idea
thanks: Thanks so much | That's brilliant, thanks
wow: Oh, look at that | Brilliant
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: share
openness: open
loves: music
likes: sweet | book
invites: music
joy: counting up the boat fund
thread: leaving
keepsake: a sketch of the boat, with every name he's given it crossed out but one
avoid: telling anyone their own health details (he talks facts, never patients)
